  "notes": [
    "A visual patrol pass adds original Blender service bays, pressure gauges, valves and floor drains to Blackwater, plus weathered stone urns and rooted remnants to sparse Briarwake passages. Placement reserves objective, refuge, cabinet and lantern space.",
    "Briarwake\u2019s wind bell and root altar have new detailed Blender models. Their signals are set into physical fittings, replacing block-like geometry and a floating indicator.",
    "Easy and Normal have fewer redundant maze shortcuts, while every objective and refuge remains reachable. Easy hunters can gain on ordinary walking; generous sprint, light and hiding advantages remain.",
    "Blackwater breaker chimes have a 35 m maximum source distance, reduced from 40 m. Directional audio and hunter sounds are retained.",
    "The wall-integrated surface exit is retained. This update changes maze layouts and requires everyone in a co-op group to update; older builds cannot join these lobbies.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart."
  ],
